      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "JUD",
          "chapter": 1,
          "verse": 8
        }
      ],
      "en": "Yet in the same way, these also in their dreaming defile the flesh, despise authority, and slander celestial beings.",
      "ko": "그러한데 꿈꾸는 이 사람들도 그와 같이 육체를 더럽히며 권위를 업신여기며 영광을 훼방하는도다",
      "source_text_hash": "c0837490a4ea77114c958543fa83bcb8fc809988e86d2bab7b53db84580b44f0",
      "translation_text_hash": "06c6e0cb363342f3fdc1c1efbe23a7ad78550c5cf25748de7dd94131faf1a982",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
